  "description": "A fully asynchronous library providing a set of functional functions for interacting with various SQL and NoSQL databases. Includes async managers for Microsoft SQL Server, Redis, MongoDB, MySQL, Oracle, and RabbitMQ.",
  "id": "PublicFunction.AsyncDataBase",
